---
/**
 * "What it isn't" — disqualifying statements that filter wrong-fit
 * clicks. Wrong-fit visitors who bounce off the Steam page hurt the
 * algorithm; setting expectations up front protects the funnel.
 *
 * Owner can edit the list directly here — short list, no data file
 * worth abstracting.
 */
import Section from '~/components/ui/Section.astro';

const DISQUALIFIERS = [
  'a battle royale',
  'free-to-play',
  'pay-to-win',
  'a hero shooter',
];
---

<Section spacing="default" variant="dark" class="border-t border-ink/10">
  <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-accent mb-3">For the record</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-display-md uppercase leading-[0.95] mb-8">
      ToyBox Security is&nbsp;<span class="text-accent">not</span>
    </h2>
    <ul class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
      {DISQUALIFIERS.map((label) => (
        <li class="px-5 py-3 rounded-full bg-bg-light/[0.05] ring-1 ring-ink/15 text-base font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink/85">
          <span class="text-accent mr-2">✗</span>{label}
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-8 text-ink-muted text-sm max-w-prose mx-auto">
      It's a 4-player online comedy where the kids and the burglars are
      equally outmatched and equally hilarious. That's it. No metas, no
      season passes, no rotating cash shops.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>
